<view class="page">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">JSON 备份</view>
    <view class="hint">药品与识别资料备份包含药品、批次、设置和逐图识别结果；仅库存备份不含逐图识别结果及来源，但仍包含药品资料和说明书摘要。</view>
    <view class="hint">两种备份都不含照片原件、单独保存的个人剂量备注或登录凭据；文字可能含个人信息，恢复后原图不可查看。</view>
    <view class="btn btn-primary" bindtap="onCreateBackup">{{busy ? "处理中…" : "生成药品与识别资料备份"}}</view>
    <view class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="onCreateInventoryBackup">生成仅库存备份</view>
    <view class="hint status-text" wx:if="{{statusText}}">{{statusText}}</view>
    <view class="hint" wx:if="{{backupCreatedAt}}">生成时间：{{backupCreatedAt}}</view>
    <textarea wx:if="{{backupJson}}" class="backup-json" value="{{backupJson}}" disabled maxlength="-1" />
    <view class="btn btn-ghost" wx:if="{{backupJson}}" bindtap="onCopyBackup">复制 JSON 内容</view>
  </view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">恢复备份</view>
    <view class="hint">先选 JSON 文件进行预览。恢复会新增记录，不会覆盖当前家庭；同名冲突请核对。</view>
    <view class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="onChooseImport">{{selectedFileName || "选择 .json 备份文件"}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{importPreview}}" class="preview-card">
      <view class="preview-title">恢复预览</view>
      <view class="hint">{{previewCountsText}}</view>
      <view class="hint conflict-text">{{conflictText}}</view>
      <view class="btn btn-primary {{!restoreAllowed || busy ? 'disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="onConfirmRestore">{{importPreview.duplicateBackup ? "此备份已恢复" : "确认恢复到当前家庭"}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="hint status-text" wx:if="{{statusText}}">{{statusText}}</view>
    <view class="hint error-text" wx:if="{{errorMessage}}">{{errorMessage}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="safety-note">数据库和说明书照片仍需通过服务器备份单独恢复。JSON 文件请保存在可信位置。</view>
</view>

<business-nav />
